      "options": {
        "content": "## ⚖️ MLOps Model A/B Comparison Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard visualises **champion vs challenger model performance** to support A/B testing and model promotion decisions.\n\n### Data Requirements\n> ⚠️ Meaningful comparison data requires **at least two distinct `model_version` label values** in `model_predictions_total`.\n> Traffic split data is produced when the serving layer routes requests to different model versions simultaneously.\n\n### Panel Guide\n| Section | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Version Traffic & Volume** | High-level prediction counts and active accuracy |\n| **Prediction Rate Over Time** | Request throughput and confidence trends per version |\n| **Prediction Distribution** | Label breakdown and traffic share per version |\n| **Model Lifecycle Events** | Reload and retraining trigger history |\n\n### Related Dashboards\n- **Model Performance**: deep-dive accuracy, latency, drift gauges\n- **Retraining Pipeline**: DAG runs, trigger history\n- **Alerts Overview**: fired alerts and service probes\n\n*Generated by MLOps Device Health System — Session 12*\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
